TOKEN tinybird_ingest APPEND
TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
The statement text behind each `query_id` in `d1_call_event`, with
placeholders only (batches joined by ";\n"). Each Worker isolate sends a
statement the first time it runs it; duplicates collapse to one row.

SCHEMA >
`query_id` String                 `json:$.query_id`,
`service`  LowCardinality(String) `json:$.service`,
`sql`      String                 `json:$.sql`

ENGINE "ReplacingMergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "query_id"
